            <div xml:id="m-039b96cd-60a0-4041-922d-1a947184b923">
              <lg xml:id="m-6e0553cd-95e4-4ae5-b643-0e558831701f">
                <l xml:id="m-1949deb6-c5fc-4dbe-89ea-e4962630f703" facs="#m-4dd4c96a-cc03-415a-91a6-9ca3cf56dacc" label="ambiguous">1046</l><l xml:id="m-1665a347-cbf2-425c-bcd6-579c844eaca2" facs="#m-56c4232e-a948-47ae-85a9-ca213145d547" label="text-like">l6th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-d744e0ac-ae29-4f57-a7eb-7c3555bc90ac" facs="#m-0de28f50-a861-4d14-a8ed-33a5a3849534" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 14.</l><l xml:id="m-d2e9cf66-5af6-4d3f-90e1-bf428fda398c" facs="#m-8a333e20-8c16-4401-9c30-5037e829ca06" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Cum intráret! accúbitus elígerent, dicens ad illos:</l><l xml:id="m-8eff6d05-62e0-437e-9082-6c40bc8ab75d" facs="#m-e21ce337-8170-425c-b2fc-88065b6c9ed8" label="lyrics-like">L Jesus in domum cujúsdam prin-Cum invitátus fúeris ad núptias, non</l><l xml:id="m-2a4b3f51-d026-46e3-96be-1fc6e4b9e9bf" facs="#m-9edd973f-2c88-4a0c-be3c-c7000ae8ec37" label="lyrics-like">cipis Pharisaeórum sábbato man- discúmbas in primo loco, ne forte</l><l xml:id="m-10cd71ea-76ec-49b2-b3f4-fd50afcd6b10" facs="#m-26e494b9-0ed2-45e2-aa2d-da6cde378686" label="lyrics-like">ducáre panem, et ipsi observábant</l><l xml:id="m-1335b07f-df32-4e03-b68f-75e93dc384d3" facs="#m-9561dc44-1815-4f36-bc14-352ee190a36a" label="lyrics-like">honorátior te sit invitátus ab illo,</l><l xml:id="m-5ef36508-2402-4628-8abb-77b80c752012" facs="#m-58a1b1d9-87c1-4b16-97e9-ccff11d6fecb" label="lyrics-like">et véniens is, qui te et illum vocá¬</l><l xml:id="m-124a8a34-4c39-46eb-8bc7-212a1929cfb0" facs="#m-8d18a8de-0be4-42cb-98b9-7d024789730d" label="lyrics-like">eum. Et ecce homo quidam hydró¬</l><l xml:id="m-0c860355-288c-45bf-a3c0-6e431eb0a184" facs="#m-6a798054-1867-42e4-8ec2-58f345742357" label="ambiguous">vit, dicat tibi: Da huic locum: et</l><l xml:id="m-83f4a54b-9966-4b34-b1c5-7550e3bba5f7" facs="#m-fca34b5a-ace0-46c3-9b24-e9aef6c5590d" label="lyrics-like">picus erat ante illum. Et respóndens</l><l xml:id="m-008ae5d9-ee22-4b06-9d0e-b182ace839d2" facs="#m-8415c021-28b7-4d37-911a-5f47d3957331" label="ambiguous">Jesus, dixit ad Legisperstos et Pha¬</l><l xml:id="m-6c1dfa9f-2b18-4af8-8f35-68993605b9c1" facs="#m-1e3240c3-3ae1-4f01-a48b-b3fd31208fd5" label="lyrics-like">tunc incípias cum rubóre novíssi¬</l><l xml:id="m-62cd3376-63d3-406a-9bd7-9c9c5bb4697f" facs="#m-97266d4a-3129-4ee5-b707-b210f7db0387" label="lyrics-like">risaéos, dicens: Si licet sábbato cu¬</l><l xml:id="m-527af5b4-4843-43c9-a46e-8db65fe216ed" facs="#m-dc1e58a9-49ea-4277-963b-260228847630" label="lyrics-like">mum locum tenére. Sed cum vocá¬</l><l xml:id="m-99256224-e3bf-4ab3-a403-44cdce0c50fd" facs="#m-379febc9-16d7-499e-99c6-6eeb00377481" label="lyrics-like">tus fúeris, vade, recúmbe in novis¬</l><l xml:id="m-2edf9c9a-abc8-4fe8-8ee4-a3d058231424" facs="#m-f511308c-2a7d-4cb6-b1a7-fb69211c5d52" label="lyrics-like">ráre? At illi tacuérunt. Ipse vero</l><l xml:id="m-6dd8a9ef-4bc1-49d9-bf05-a9dea3e111e8" facs="#m-565781aa-88ea-49d8-89da-9aad6f093106" label="lyrics-like">apprehénsum sanávit eum ac dimi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8cc234bb-1546-4065-8c52-52eaa457f128" facs="#m-d51d77f9-115d-4461-b867-45c140eefbe3" label="lyrics-like">simo loco: ut, cum vénerit qui te</l><l xml:id="m-735d2838-3928-49bb-9d64-8877ac1ea3e6" facs="#m-0c158b8c-24f7-4248-828e-bc60473252a4" label="lyrics-like">invitávit, dicat tibi : Amice, ascén¬</l><l xml:id="m-f3df5370-38b5-429a-8b23-0b288d55fdb6" facs="#m-0e80e913-80c1-4855-b847-de9fc609832d" label="lyrics-like">st. Et respóndens ad illos, dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-9d0a75eb-9b3b-4d96-9b8d-7eaa2459dfc0" facs="#m-6da493bf-b942-4528-ac09-8b1c4ad2ef99" label="lyrics-like">Cuius vestrum ásinus, aut bos in</l><l xml:id="m-165bd189-17d3-4b85-8763-1bba210f3427" facs="#m-1526905a-de6c-424f-8846-ed751e41fc83" label="lyrics-like">de supérius. Tunc erit tibi glória</l><l xml:id="m-a6ed4fd9-389f-4669-a23a-d49b1a4129b9" facs="#m-c998b455-08fd-48ce-b1c8-1ef05d23aad2" label="lyrics-like">coram simul discumbéntibus : quia</l><l xml:id="m-569a1aef-a9dd-42f8-9a08-4bba742c15da" facs="#m-e178d5b8-bc00-468a-9896-90ff9c568f7b" label="lyrics-like">púteum cadet, et non contínuo</l><l xml:id="m-3c9e0b2e-964f-44be-8537-eb13a742d1ff" facs="#m-40585c6f-67e9-4bc4-b254-9f212ca149af" label="lyrics-like">éxtrahet illum die sábbati? Et non</l><l xml:id="m-b88a7606-011d-43e6-8de7-06631da93af6" facs="#m-db3b38a8-9ba8-4431-b12d-338280431a1c" label="lyrics-like">omnis qui se exáltat, humiliábitur:</l><l xml:id="m-fe511c9b-d250-4e36-ac65-3c00ce0d8830" facs="#m-0ffd86b9-55d3-4b65-91b1-62ff7ec152bc" label="lyrics-like">et qui se humiliat, exaltábitur.</l><l xml:id="m-6173afff-34ae-46f0-ad5a-6a13d0dfcddb" facs="#m-4d9aafa6-4d25-4be1-9176-853b77578eb4" label="lyrics-like">póterant ad haec respondére illi.</l><l xml:id="m-0286e5ec-5f0e-41fc-934f-652b28119b88" facs="#m-4b8ac481-b76c-447f-b11e-2fee3b263847" label="lyrics-like">Dicébat autem et ad invitátos pará¬</l><l xml:id="m-58f3a085-f20c-4b27-8bee-b698949af110" facs="#m-b7be959c-ef04-4643-9982-02b40f0bbd12" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-9c8a0858-8f14-4957-a7b9-10731db4aab5" facs="#m-5f4e238a-0254-41fd-b117-03e71eb274ec" label="lyrics-like">bolam, inténdens quómodo primos</l><l xml:id="m-bb4cf10f-1bc7-4d7e-8142-d260e4ce9dff" facs="#m-5cb2845c-bf71-47cd-bb01-80e4fe984230" label="ambiguous">orert.&amp;</l><l xml:id="m-3683569c-85fe-499d-93c3-690b009bb427" facs="#m-3aa49bd6-288e-421c-8ab7-469ad0cad501" label="lyrics-like">DOmi- ne, * in auxí-li- um mé- um réspi-ce:</l><l xml:id="m-6b9c1db3-dcc9-4f09-8734-f2bd4f149f91" facs="#m-4496d23d-8eef-4b4f-ab1a-8da83812d529" label="lyrics-like">confundántur et reve-re-án¬ tur, qui quaé-runt áni¬</l><l xml:id="m-51ac15f9-09ed-456b-9ed6-e01cd72d38f8" facs="#m-c551c527-7c29-49dc-9387-502b36db8a95" label="lyrics-like">Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a6b6e8a8-93e8-498e-b402-f9c2a507e975" facs="#m-ca755cd6-2339-46c1-8cfc-fa233b64e1fc" label="lyrics-like">ut áufe-rant</l><l xml:id="m-502181be-545f-4378-80f7-d4103a9d9e1c" facs="#m-fe9a9cea-6620-4475-9554-d1a6a93013bc" label="lyrics-like">é-am:</l><l xml:id="m-7992e024-f93d-4129-83f0-d505ccb4a424" facs="#m-1508280c-c11d-45c9-b8d3-0a9ae6e56a62" label="lyrics-like">mam mé¬ am,</l><l xml:id="m-aeb881ed-330d-4013-880f-019094d652a9" facs="#m-694cb73f-0aca-434d-ad6a-f3f114ed387a" label="lyrics-like">mi- ne, in auxí- li- um mé¬ um réspi-ce.</l><l xml:id="m-564b5d72-bf1c-4f19-8252-023916297f32" facs="#m-72d75b49-af5f-4deb-ad1e-24bbed7e0c00" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-2ffe7d0a-21c2-42ba-930a-90fc9011291b" facs="#m-a4e0a9ab-55d0-4aa8-b11b-40c1d1fc1d15" label="lyrics-like">Unda nos, quaésumus Dómine, (ejus mereámur esse participes. Per</l><l xml:id="m-f5f9e97c-ecd9-4e73-a1e4-6716f261576c" facs="#m-e7ba7efd-4201-4d54-8a68-434bb8bd4dd8" label="lyrics-like">31 sacrificii praeséntis efféctu Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-a4002fe8-56ab-455b-bf58-887cebd56c5a" facs="#m-3abbf172-178c-41d9-9613-1774fda0f4ed" label="lyrics-like">et pérfice miserátus in nobis; ut</l><l xml:id="m-739665fd-c65b-4b84-b25d-4576272d31af" facs="#m-0e27964c-aba4-45b2-91a3-55860ef5b10b" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-d92d1f0c-c37a-49bb-a0bb-d564c535853f" facs="#m-0bd8a56f-573a-426b-9bb1-1e9dc186e425" label="ambiguous">comm.!</l><l xml:id="m-6f7852e1-1945-4dc3-b9f1-820261e9b30e" facs="#m-3a7d8876-3086-4395-b084-ba91e9a4341c" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-d34e4697-0654-431c-af67-3df598114f3f" facs="#m-5c7b120b-88be-43b4-bb79-b517a0ebeb48" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-9761455c-45a4-45ad-b5ba-ad51cb0cf132" facs="#m-0a8c492c-ff1c-4e72-ab0e-83d9d883e925" label="lyrics-like">Omine, "memo-rá- bor justí- ti- ae tú- ae</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
